      "writtenOn": "2014-02-06T16:16:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I am sure.  See the code in python-keystone client that ensuers that ethe eventlet implementation is used:  it is what the rest of openstack needs to deal with:\n\nhttps://github.com/openstack/python-keystoneclient/blob/master/keystoneclient/common/cms.py#L37\n\nAnd we can\u0027t work around it:  the rest of OpenStack is not going to use the environment check that we do, least not in a timely manner.",
